The {{Term/Store|Of the Wind Set||Series, TotK}},{{Exp Game|TotK}}<ref name="TotK Piggyback 404"/> also known as the {{Term/Store|Hero of Winds Set||BotW}},{{Exp Game|BotW}}<ref name="CaC 193"/> is a recurring [[Armor Set]] in {{TLoZ Series}}.

==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Noncanon|Start}}
{{Descriptions BotW}}
The Hero of Winds Set is an [[Armor Set]] consisting of the [[Cap of the Wind]], [[Tunic of the Wind]], and [[Trousers of the Wind]]. All three pieces can be obtained using the [[amiibo (Ability)|amiibo]] [[Rune]] while scanning the {{SSB|-}} series Toon Link or {{TLoZ|-}} 30th Anniversary series Toon Link [[amiibo]]. Each time the figure is scanned, a [[Metal Chest]] will appear that has a small chance of containing one of the pieces. As each amiibo can only be scanned once per real-world day, the set must be collected over two or more real-world days. 

The Hero of Winds Set can be enhanced by a [[Great Fairy]] but cannot be [[Dye]]d at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]]. When each piece has been enhanced by two levels, the Master Sword Beam Up [[Set Bonus]] takes effect when the full set is worn. It resembles [[Link]]'s outfit from {{TWW}}. 

